function signalSources(){draw('Signal sources',`${['Webinar attendance','Website inquiries','Content downloads','Referral notes'].map((n,i)=>`<div class="listitem row"><b>${n}</b>${tag('Sample source','green')}</div>`).join('')}<p class="sidehelp">Source matching is demonstrated using illustrative account data.</p>`)}
function routingRulesSaas(){return `<div class="appbody"><div class="sectionhead"><div><h2>Get the right lead to the right person.</h2><p>Transparent rules combine account fit, intent, and team ownership.</p></div>${ib('Add routing rule','editRoute(-1)','plus','primary')}</div>${surface('Routing rules',table(['Priority','When a lead matches','Assign to','Response target',''],(state.routes||[['High','Score ≥ 85 and operations intent','Alex Morgan','2 hours'],['High','Finance inquiry and enterprise account','Jordan Ellis','2 hours'],['Nurture','Webinar engagement only','Nurture team','2 business days']]).map((r,i)=>[tag(r[0],r[0]==='High'?'green':''),r[1],r[2],r[3],ib('Edit',`editRoute(${i})`,'settings')])))}<p class="product-footer-note">${icon('help')} Rules are illustrative and saved in this browser session.</p></div>`}
function editRoute(i){state.routes=state.routes||[['High','Score ≥ 85 and operations intent','Alex Morgan','2 hours'],['High','Finance inquiry and enterprise account','Jordan Ellis','2 hours'],['Nurture','Webinar engagement only','Nurture team','2 business days']];let r=i<0?['High','','','2 hours']:state.routes[i];draw(i<0?'New routing rule':'Edit routing rule',field('Condition','routeCondition',r[1])+field('Owner','routeOwner',r[2])+field('Response target','routeTarget',r[3])+ib('Save rule',`let r=['High',document.getElementById('routeCondition').value,document.getElementById('routeOwner').value,document.getElementById('routeTarget').value];if(${i}<0)state.routes.push(r);else state.routes[${i}]=r;closeDrawer();render()`,'check','primary'))}
function importLeadsDialog(){draw('Import a lead list',`<div class="callout">Preview the import workflow with a CSV file. Files are selected locally; this demo does not upload or enrich contact data.</div><label class="field" style="margin-top:22px">Choose a CSV file<input type="file" accept=".csv" onchange="document.getElementById('importState').textContent=this.files[0]?'Selected: '+this.files[0].name:''"></label><p id="importState" class="subtle"></p><h2>Expected columns</h2><p class="muted">Name · Company · Role · Email · Source</p>${ib('Use sample accounts','closeDrawer();tab=0;render()','arrow','primary')}`)}
function filterTableRows(q,cls){document.querySelectorAll('tbody .'+cls).forEach(el=>el.style.display=el.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase())?'table-row':'none')}
function simulationSaas(){if(tab===2)return simulationCompare();let selected=state.simPersonas.filter(Boolean).length;let scores=[87,72,76,91,78].map(x=>Math.min(97,x+(state.simulation===2?6:0)));return `<div class="appbody"><div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><select aria-label="Test type" onchange="state.simMode=this.value;persist()">${['Proposal / pitch','Marketing message','Product concept','Strategy'].map(x=>`<option ${state.simMode===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select><select aria-label="Industry" onchange="state.simIndustry=this.value;persist()">${['Professional services','Manufacturing','Financial services','Healthcare'].map(x=>`<option ${state.simIndustry===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="controlgroup">${tag(state.simulation?'Round '+state.simulation:'Not yet run',state.simulation?'green':'')}${ib('Test history','simulationHistory()','clock')}</div></div>${tab===0?`<div class="two" style="grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr">${surface('What would you like the room to react to?',`<div class="row" style="margin-bottom:20px"><span class="sourcebadge">${esc(state.simMode)}</span><span class="subtle">Version ${state.simulation===2?'2':'1'}</span></div><textarea id="simtext" style="min-height:250px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;padding:20px" oninput="state.simcontent=this.value;persist()">${esc(state.simcontent)}</textarea><div class="row" style="margin-top:18px"><span class="subtle">Be specific. Give the panel enough context to respond.</span>${ib('Run analysis','runPanelSaaS()','spark','primary')}</div>`)}${surface('Build your focus group',`<p class="muted" style="font-size:11px;margin-top:0">Choose the perspectives that will make this feedback useful.</p>${panelNames.map((n,i)=>`<div class="listitem row" style="padding:14px 0"><div class="person"><span class="avatar" style="background:${['#e8dfcc','#dbe6dc','#e0e1e8','#ebdcd4','#e4e1d5'][i]}">${['AM','JE','TK','SR','CL'][i]}</span><div><b style="font-size:11px">${n}</b><small style="display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px">${['Strategic fit & outcomes','Cost, value & evidence','Data, security & integration','Daily usability & adoption','Scope & accountability'][i]}</small></div></div><input class="rowcheck" type="checkbox" aria-label="Include ${n}" ${state.simPersonas[i]?'checked':''} onchange="state.simPersonas[${i}]=this.checked;persist();document.getElementById('panelCount').textContent=state.simPersonas.filter(Boolean).length+' perspectives selected'"></div>`).join('')}<p id="panelCount" class="subtle">${selected} perspectives selected</p>`)}</div><div class="decisionstrip" style="margin-top:22px"><div class="dsicon">${icon('simulation')}</div><div><b>Simulated perspectives. Actionable questions.</b><p>This is directional AI feedback—not a prediction of how real people will respond.</p></div></div>`:`${slim([['Clarity',state.simulation===2?'92 / 100':'84 / 100','Sample panel assessment'],['Relevance','89 / 100','Strong operational fit'],['Confidence',state.simulation===2?'87 / 100':'71 / 100','Evidence & specificity'],['Perspectives',selected,'Selected panel members']])}<div class="panelroom"><div class="sectionhead"><div><h2>The room’s response</h2><p>${esc(state.simIndustry)} · Round ${state.simulation||1}</p></div>${ib('Refine & compare','tab=2;render()','arrow','primary')}</div><div class="roomtable" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(${Math.min(5,Math.max(1,selected))},1fr)">${panelNames.map((n,i)=>state.simPersonas[i]?`<button class="personacard" onclick="personaDetail(${i})"><div class="portrait">${['AM','JE','TK','SR','CL'][i]}</div><h3>${n}</h3><p>${['Clear direction','Needs cost evidence','Clarify data access','Strong daily benefit','Define acceptance criteria'][i]}</p>${tag(scores[i]+'/100',scores[i]>80?'green':'amber')}</button>`:'').join('')}</div></div><div class="two" style="margin-top:22px">${surface('The changes that would matter most',`<div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">1</span><div><b>Make the outcome measurable.</b><p>Set a baseline, a named owner, and a review cadence.</p></div></div><div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">2</span><div><b>Explain the implementation boundary.</b><p>Specify the systems, access rules, and deliverables.</p></div></div><div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">3</span><div><b>Make the investment explicit.</b><p>Separate the build from ongoing cloud and model usage.</p></div></div>`)}${surface('Tested content',`<span class="sourcebadge">${esc(state.simMode)}</span><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;margin-top:20px">${esc(state.simcontent)}</p><div class="callout"><b>What the panel agrees on</b><br>The practical first-iteration approach is compelling. Specific success measures would make it more credible.</div>`)}</div>`}</div>`}
function runPanelSaaS(){if(!state.simcontent.trim()){toast('Add the content you want to test');return}if(!state.simPersonas.some(Boolean)){toast('Select at least one perspective');return}state.simulation=Math.max(1,state.simulation);state.simHistory=state.simHistory||[];state.simHistory.push({content:state.simcontent,industry:state.simIndustry,count:state.simPersonas.filter(Boolean).length,round:state.simulation});tab=1;render()}
function simulationCompare(){let revised=state.simRevised||'We will establish a weekly reporting baseline with your operations owner, deliver a first working iteration in two weeks, and review adoption every fortnight. The pilot will use approved data sources and existing role permissions. Success will be measured against the agreed baseline over 90 days.';return `<div class="appbody"><div class="sectionhead"><div><h2>Turn feedback into a stronger version.</h2><p>Compare the original with your revision, then run the panel again.</p></div>${tag('Revision workspace')}</div><div class="comparison">${surface('Original · Version 1',`<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;white-space:pre-wrap">${esc(state.simHistory?.[0]?.content||state.simcontent)}</p><div class="metadata"><div><label>CLARITY</label><b>84 / 100</b></div><div><label>CONFIDENCE</label><b>71 / 100</b></div></div>`)}${surface('Refined · Version 2',`<textarea id="refinedSim" style="min-height:260px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.95" oninput="state.simRevised=this.value;persist()">${esc(revised)}</textarea><div class="suggestions">${tag('Measurable success')}${tag('Named owner')}${tag('Permission boundary')}</div>${ib('Run this version',"state.simcontent=document.getElementById('refinedSim').value;state.simRevised=state.simcontent;state.simulation=2;runPanelSaaS()",'spark','primary')}`)}</div></div>`}
function simulationHistory(){draw('Test history',(state.simHistory||[]).length?(state.simHistory||[]).map((x,i)=>`<div class="listitem"><div class="row"><b>Round ${x.round}</b>${tag(x.count+' perspectives')}</div><p>${esc(x.industry)}</p><p class="muted">${esc(x.content.slice(0,160))}…</p>${ib('Load test',`state.simcontent=state.simHistory[${i}].content;closeDrawer();tab=0;render()`,'arrow')}</div>`).join(''):'<div class="emptyspace">'+icon('simulation')+'<h2>Your first test starts here.</h2><p>Run a focus group to build a history of your iterations.</p></div>')}
function budgetSaas(){if(tab===2)return budgetApprovalSaas();let h=v2[4]();return h.replace('<div class="sheettoolbar">',`<div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><span class="projectphase">${icon('budget')} FY 2027</span><span class="projectphase">USD · Annual plan</span></div><div class="controlgroup">${ib('Comments'+(state.budgetComments.length?' · '+state.budgetComments.length:''),'budgetCommentsDialog()','file')}${ib('Export CSV','exportBudgetSaas()','download')}</div></div><div class="sheettoolbar">`)}
function budgetCommentsDialog(){draw('Planning comments',`${state.budgetComments.map(c=>`<div class="listitem"><b>Alex Morgan</b><p>${esc(c)}</p><span class="subtle">This planning session</span></div>`).join('')}<label class="field">Add a note<textarea id="budgetComment" placeholder="Capture an assumption or question for the finance team…"></textarea></label>${ib('Add comment',"let v=document.getElementById('budgetComment').value.trim();if(v){state.budgetComments.push(v);persist();budgetCommentsDialog()}",'plus','primary')}`)}
function exportBudgetSaas(){download('Nine-67-budget-plan.csv','Department,Prior year,Annual plan,Variance\n'+['Operations','Marketing','Technology','People'].map((x,i)=>[x,[160000,80000,55000,45000][i],state.budget[i],state.budget[i]-[160000,80000,55000,45000][i]].join(',')).join('\n'))}
function budgetApprovalSaas(){let total=state.budget.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);return `<div class="appbody"><div class="decisionstrip"><div class="dsicon">${icon('budget')}</div><div><b>FY 2027 operating plan</b><p>${money(total)} across four departments. ${((total/340000-1)*100).toFixed(1)}% above the prior-year plan.</p></div>${tag(state.budgetSubmitted?'Submitted':'Draft',state.budgetSubmitted?'green':'amber')}</div><div class="two equal">${surface('Review checklist',`${['Department allocations confirmed','Headcount assumptions reviewed','Cloud and model usage included','Contingency agreed with finance'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="listitem row"><span>${x}</span><input aria-label="${x}" type="checkbox" class="rowcheck" ${state['budgetCheck'+i]?'checked':''} onchange="state['budgetCheck'+${i}]=this.checked;persist()"></div>`).join('')}<div style="margin-top:22px">${ib(state.budgetSubmitted?'Submitted for review':'Submit plan',"if([0,1,2,3].every(i=>state['budgetCheck'+i])){state.budgetSubmitted=true;render();toast('Plan submitted in this demo')}else toast('Complete the review checklist first')",'check','primary')}</div>`)}${surface('Approval path',`${[['Department owners','Allocations and team assumptions','Complete'],['Finance','Financial consistency and contingency',state.budgetSubmitted?'In review':'Pending'],['Leadership','Final plan approval','Pending']].map(([x,y,z],i)=>`<div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">${i===0?'✓':i+1}</span><div style="flex:1"><div class="row"><b>${x}</b>${tag(z,z==='Complete'?'green':'')}</div><p>${y}</p></div></div>`).join('')}`)}</div><p class="product-footer-note">${icon('lock')} Approval is simulated. No notifications are sent.</p></div>`}
function salesSaas(){if(tab===1)return salesPipelineSaas();let h=v2[5]();return h.replace('<div class="dashboardtop">',`<div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><span class="projectphase">${icon('sales')} All business units</span><span class="projectphase">Fiscal year 2026</span></div><div class="controlgroup">${ib('Pipeline review','tab=1;render()','list')}${ib('Model scenarios','nav(9)','forecast')}</div></div><div class="dashboardtop">`)}
function salesPipelineSaas(){let ds=state.deals.filter(d=>(state.salesStage==='All stages'||d.stage===state.salesStage)&&(d.name+' '+d.company+' '+d.owner).toLowerCase().includes(state.salesSearch.toLowerCase()));let weighted=state.deals.reduce((a,d)=>a+d.value*d.prob/100,0);return `<div class="appbody">${slim([['Open opportunities',state.deals.length,'In the sample pipeline'],['Unweighted value',money(state.deals.reduce((a,d)=>a+d.value,0)),'Across all stages'],['Weighted value',money(weighted),'Value × probability'],['Closing this quarter',state.deals.length,'Expected Q4 close dates']])}<div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><input id="dealSearch" placeholder="Search opportunities…" value="${esc(state.salesSearch)}" oninput="state.salesSearch=this.value;filterDealsLive()"><select onchange="state.salesStage=this.value;render()">${['All stages','Qualified','Discovery','Proposal','Negotiation','Closed won'].map(x=>`<option ${state.salesStage===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="controlgroup">${ib('Export','exportSales()','download')}</div></div>${surface('Opportunity workspace',`<div id="dealTable">${dealTable(ds)}</div>`)}<div class="inapp-ai" style="margin-top:22px">${icon('spark')}<span><b>Next best action:</b> Confirm the economic buyer and decision date on the two late-stage opportunities.</span></div></div>`}
function dealTable(ds){return table(['Opportunity','Stage','Amount','Probability','Owner','Expected close',''],ds.map(d=>{let i=state.deals.indexOf(d);return [`<b>${esc(d.name)}</b><small>${esc(d.company)}</small>`,tag(d.stage,d.stage==='Negotiation'||d.stage==='Closed won'?'green':'amber'),money(d.value),d.prob+'%',`<div class="person">${ava(d.owner)}${esc(d.owner.split(' ')[0])}</div>`,d.close,ib('','editDealSaas('+i+')','chevron')]}))+(ds.length?'':'<div class="emptyspace">No opportunities match these filters.</div>')}
function filterDealsLive(){let ds=state.deals.filter(d=>(state.salesStage==='All stages'||d.stage===state.salesStage)&&(d.name+' '+d.company+' '+d.owner).toLowerCase().includes(state.salesSearch.toLowerCase()));$('#dealTable').innerHTML=dealTable(ds);persist()}
function editDealSaas(i){let d=state.deals[i];draw(d.company,`<span class="sourcebadge">OPPORTUNITY DETAILS</span><h2 style="margin-top:18px">${esc(d.name)}</h2><div class="modalmetric"><div><label>Opportunity value</label><b>${money(d.value)}</b></div><div><label>Weighted value</label><b>${money(d.value*d.prob/100)}</b></div></div>${field('Amount','dealAmount',d.value,'number')}<label class="field">Stage<select id="dealStage">${['Qualified','Discovery','Proposal','Negotiation','Closed won'].map(s=>`<option ${s===d.stage?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>${field('Probability (%)','dealProbability',d.prob,'number')}${field('Owner','dealOwner',d.owner)}${field('Expected close date','dealClose',d.close,'date')}${ib('Save opportunity',`let d=state.deals[${i}];d.value=Math.max(0,+document.getElementById('dealAmount').value);d.stage=document.getElementById('dealStage').value;d.prob=Math.min(100,Math.max(0,+document.getElementById('dealProbability').value));d.owner=document.getElementById('dealOwner').value;d.close=document.getElementById('dealClose').value;closeDrawer();render();toast('Opportunity updated')`,'check','primary')}`)}
function exportSales(){download('Nine-67-sales-pipeline.csv','Opportunity,Company,Amount,Stage,Probability,Owner,Close date\n'+state.deals.map(d=>[d.name,d.company,d.value,d.stage,d.prob,d.owner,d.close].map(x=>'"'+String(x).replaceAll('"','""')+'"').join(',')).join('\n'))}
function resourcesSaas(){let team=state.team.filter(t=>state.resourceFilter==='All disciplines'||t[1]===state.resourceFilter);let total=state.team.reduce((a,t)=>a+t[2],0),over=state.team.filter(t=>t[2]>40).length;return `<div class="appbody"><div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><div class="segmented">${ib('','state.resourceWeek=Math.max(0,state.resourceWeek-1);render()','chevron')}${btn(state.resourceWeek===0?'Oct 19 – 23':'Oct '+(19+state.resourceWeek*7)+' – '+(23+state.resourceWeek*7),'state.resourceWeek=0;render()')}${ib('','state.resourceWeek=Math.min(1,state.resourceWeek+1);render()','chevron')}</div>${btn('Today','state.resourceWeek=0;render()')}</div><div class="controlgroup"><select onchange="state.resourceFilter=this.value;render()">${['All disciplines',...state.team.map(x=>x[1])].map(s=>`<option ${state.resourceFilter===s?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select>${ib('Team availability','availabilityDialog()','user')}</div></div>${slim([['Scheduled capacity',Math.round(total/200*100)+'%','Five sample team members'],['Over capacity',over+' people',over?'Review assignments':'Balanced this week'],['Unallocated capacity',Math.max(0,200-total)+' hrs','Against 200 total hours'],['Active workstreams','5','Across the delivery team']])}${tab===2?`<div class="two equal">${surface('Capacity risks',over?state.team.filter(t=>t[2]>40).map(t=>`<div class="listitem"><div class="row"><b>${t[0]}</b>${tag(t[2]-40+' hours over','red')}</div><p class="muted">Current assignment load exceeds the 40-hour weekly baseline.</p></div>`).join(''):'<div class="callout"><b>No capacity overruns in the sample plan.</b><br>Review upcoming absences before confirming the next week.</div>')}${surface('Suggested resolution',`<p class="muted">Move 8 hours of reporting work from Alex to Jordan, and 4 hours of testing from Taylor to Sam.</p>${ib('Review proposed changes','rebalanceDialog()','spark','primary')}`)}</div>`:tab===1?surface('Assignment register',table(['Team member','Discipline','Project','Hours','Load',''],team.map(t=>{let i=state.team.indexOf(t);return [`<div class="person">${ava(t[0])}<b>${t[0]}</b></div>`,t[1],['Reporting platform','Forecast Builder','Client workspace','Testing & validation','Pilot delivery'][i],t[2],tag(Math.round(t[2]/40*100)+'%',t[2]>40?'red':'green'),ib('Edit',`editAssignmentSaas(${i})`,'settings')]}))):`<div class="schedule"><div class="plannerfilter"><span>Weekly resource planner</span><div class="legend"><span><i style="background:#c2d3b9"></i>Assigned</span><span><i style="background:#e0c79e"></i>Shared</span><span><i style="background:#d5a68c"></i>Over capacity</span></div></div><div class="schedhead"><div style="text-align:left">PEOPLE & CAPACITY</div>${['MON','TUE','WED','THU','FRI'].map((x,i)=>`<div>${x} ${19+state.resourceWeek*7+i}</div>`).join('')}</div>${team.map(t=>{let i=state.team.indexOf(t);return `<div class="schedrow"><div><div class="schedperson">${ava(t[0])}<div><b>${t[0]}</b><small>${t[1]}</small></div></div><div class="row" style="font-size:9px;margin-top:10px"><span>${t[2]} / 40 hours</span><b style="color:${t[2]>40?'var(--red)':'var(--green)'}">${Math.round(t[2]/40*100)}%</b></div></div>${Array.from({length:5},(_,j)=>`<div><div class="allocation ${t[2]>40?'red':i%2?'gold':''}" onclick="editAssignmentSaas(${i})"><b>${['Reporting','Forecast model','Workspace','Quality review','Pilot delivery'][i]}</b><br>${(t[2]/5).toFixed(1)} hours</div>${j===2?`<div class="subtle" style="margin-top:8px">${icon('clock')} Weekly check-in</div>`:''}</div>`).join('')}</div>`}).join('')}</div>`}<div class="inapp-ai" style="margin-top:22px">${icon('spark')}<span><b>${over?'Protect delivery without overloading the team.':'A more balanced week.'}</b> ${over?'Review a skill-matched reassignment to use available capacity.':'The current sample allocation is within each person’s weekly capacity.'}</span>${ib('Review plan','rebalanceDialog()','arrow')}</div></div>`}
function editAssignmentSaas(i){let t=state.team[i];draw(t[0],`<span class="sourcebadge">${t[1]}</span><h2 style="margin-top:22px">Weekly assignment</h2>${field('Assigned hours','assignHours',t[2],'number')}<div class="callout"><b>Capacity baseline: 40 hours</b><br>Adjust the weekly assignment. The planner and capacity metrics will update.</div><div style="margin-top:20px">${ib('Save assignment',`state.team[${i}][2]=Math.max(0,+document.getElementById('assignHours').value);closeDrawer();render()`,'check','primary')}</div>`)}
function rebalanceDialog(){draw('A more balanced delivery plan',`${table(['Person','Current','Proposed'],state.team.map((t,i)=>[t[0],t[2]+' hrs',[36,34,38,32,35][i]+' hrs']))}<div class="callout" style="margin-top:20px">The sample recommendation matches available skills and keeps the planned deadlines unchanged. Confirm availability with the team before using a real plan.</div><div style="margin-top:20px">${ib('Apply recommended plan',"state.team.forEach((t,i)=>t[2]=[36,34,38,32,35][i]);state.rebalance=true;closeDrawer();render();toast('Team plan rebalanced')",'check','primary')}</div>`)}
function availabilityDialog(){draw('Team availability',table(['Person','Weekly capacity','Upcoming absence'],state.team.map((t,i)=>[t[0],'40 hours',i===4?'Friday afternoon · 4 hours':'None recorded']))+'<p class="sidehelp">Availability shown is illustrative.</p>')}
function collaborationSaas(){if(tab===2)return collaborationFiles();if(tab===3)return collaborationPeople();return `<div class="appbody"><div class="projectbanner"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="font-size:9px">PROJECT WORKSPACE / NINE-67</div><h1>Operations modernization</h1><p>Project home · Reporting workflow pilot · October 2026</p></div><div><div class="stackedavatars" style="margin-bottom:12px">${ava('Alex Morgan')}${ava('Taylor Kim')}${ava('Morgan Hayes')}</div>${tag('On track','green')}</div></div><div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><div class="segmented">${ib('Board','state.workspaceView="board";render()','grid',state.workspaceView==='board'?'active':'')}${ib('List','state.workspaceView="list";render()','list',state.workspaceView==='list'?'active':'')}</div>${ib('Project links','projectLinksDialog()','link')}</div><div class="controlgroup"><select aria-label="Preview stakeholder role" onchange="state.role=this.value;render()">${['Internal team','Client','Contractor'].map(x=>`<option ${state.role===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>${ib('Add task','createBoardTask()','plus')}</div></div><div class="role">${icon('lock')} &nbsp; ${state.role} role preview · ${state.role==='Internal team'?'All project work, files, and team administration':state.role==='Client'?'Shared project tasks, approvals, and deliverables':'Assigned work and shared project files'} · Permissions are simulated; sample controls remain available.</div>${tab===1||state.workspaceView==='list'?surface('Project plan',table(['Task','Owner','Due','Status',''],state.board.map((t,i)=>[esc(t.name),`<div class="person">${ava(t.owner)}${esc(t.owner)}</div>`,t.date,tag(['To do','In progress','Complete'][t.stage],t.stage===2?'green':t.stage===1?'amber':''),ib('','editBoardTask('+i+')','chevron')]))):`<div class="two" style="grid-template-columns:1.7fr 1fr"><div><div class="kanban">${[0,1,2].map(stage=>`<section class="lane" ondragover="event.preventDefault();this.classList.add('dragover')" ondragleave="this.classList.remove('dragover')" ondrop="dropBoardTask(event,${stage})"><h3>${['TO DO','IN PROGRESS','COMPLETE'][stage]}<span>${state.board.filter(t=>t.stage===stage).length}</span></h3>${state.board.map((t,i)=>t.stage===stage?`<div class="task" draggable="true" ondragstart="event.dataTransfer.setData('text/plain','${i}')" onclick="editBoardTask(${i})">${tag(t.label,stage===2?'green':'')}<p style="margin:12px 0 0"><b>${esc(t.name)}</b></p><div class="row"><span class="subtle">${t.date}</span>${ava(t.owner)}</div></div>`:'').join('')}${btn('+ Add task',`createBoardTask(${stage})`,'addtask')}</section>`).join('')}</div><div class="two equal" style="margin-top:20px">${surface('Shared files',`<div class="filechip"><span class="fileicon">${icon('file')}</span><div><b>Pilot brief.pdf</b><small>SharePoint · Updated today</small></div></div><div class="filechip"><span class="fileicon">${icon('file')}</span><div><b>Dashboard preview.pdf</b><small>Client review · Latest version</small></div></div>${ib('View files','tab=2;render()','arrow')}`)}${surface('Next milestone',`<span class="eyebrow" style="font-size:9px">OCTOBER 23, 2026</span><h2 style="font-size:20px;margin:12px 0">Pilot review</h2><p class="muted">Review the dashboard with the pilot team and confirm the next refinements.</p>${bar(state.board.filter(t=>t.stage===2).length/state.board.length*100)}<p class="subtle">${state.board.filter(t=>t.stage===2).length} of ${state.board.length} tasks complete</p>`)}</div></div>${surface('Project conversation',`<div class="messagefeed collab-activity"><div class="feedpost">${ava('Taylor Kim')}<div><b>Taylor Kim</b><span class="timestamp"> · 24 minutes ago</span><p>The dashboard preview is ready. I’ve added the exception view we discussed. Feedback is welcome before Friday.</p>${tag('Dashboard preview.pdf')}</div></div><div class="feedpost">${ava('Alex Morgan')}<div><b>Alex Morgan</b><span class="timestamp"> · 1 hour ago</span><p>Data mapping is complete. The next review will focus on ownership and handoffs.</p></div></div>${state.posts.map(x=>`<div class="feedpost">${ava(state.role==='Client'?'Morgan Hayes':'Alex Morgan')}<div><b>${state.role}</b><span class="timestamp"> · Just now</span><p>${esc(x)}</p></div></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="composer"><input id="post" placeholder="Write a project update…" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')post()">${ib('','post()','arrow','primary')}</div><p class="product-footer-note">${icon('link')} Teams workflow preview · No live notifications</p>`)}</div>`}</div>`}
function createBoardTask(stage=0){draw('Create a project task',field('Task title','taskTitle','')+field('Owner','taskOwner','Alex Morgan')+field('Due date','taskDate','2026-10-23','date')+ib('Create task',`let n=document.getElementById('taskTitle').value.trim();if(n){state.board.push({name:n,owner:document.getElementById('taskOwner').value||'Alex Morgan',date:document.getElementById('taskDate').value,stage:${stage},label:'Planning'});closeDrawer();render()}else toast('Add a task title')`,'plus','primary'))}
function editBoardTask(i){let t=state.board[i];draw(t.name,`${field('Task title','taskTitle',t.name)}${field('Owner','taskOwner',t.owner)}<label class="field">Status<select id="taskStage">${['To do','In progress','Complete'].map((x,j)=>`<option value="${j}" ${t.stage===j?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label class="field">Notes<textarea id="taskNotes">${esc(t.notes||'Review acceptance criteria with the project owner.')}</textarea></label>${ib('Save task',`let t=state.board[${i}];t.name=document.getElementById('taskTitle').value;t.owner=document.getElementById('taskOwner').value;t.stage=+document.getElementById('taskStage').value;t.notes=document.getElementById('taskNotes').value;t.label=t.stage===2?'Complete':t.stage===1?'Delivery':'Planning';closeDrawer();render()`,'check','primary')}`)}
function dropBoardTask(e,s){e.preventDefault();let i=+e.dataTransfer.getData('text/plain');if(Number.isInteger(i)&&state.board[i]){state.board[i].stage=s;state.board[i].label=['Planning','Delivery','Complete'][s];render()}}
function collaborationFiles(){let fs=['Pilot brief.pdf','Data mapping.xlsx','Dashboard preview.pdf','Workshop notes.docx'];return `<div class="appbody"><div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><input placeholder="Search project files…" oninput="filterTableRows(this.value,'filerow')"><span class="sourcechip">${icon('link')} SharePoint</span></div>${ib('Add file','addWorkspaceFile()','plus','primary')}</div>${surface('Project files',table(['Name','Location','Access','Updated',''],[...fs,...(state.localFiles||[])].map((x,i)=>[`<div class="person"><span class="fileicon">${icon('file')}</span><b>${esc(x)}</b></div>`,i<4?'Project documents':'Local demonstration',tag(i===3?'Internal':'Client-visible',i===3?'':'green'),i<2?'Today':i===2?'Yesterday':'This session',ib('Preview',`previewWorkspaceFile(${i})`,'chevron')])).replaceAll('<tr>','<tr class="filerow">'))}<div class="two equal" style="margin-top:22px">${surface('Pinned project links',`${['Project plan','Pilot success measures','Shared files','Team discussion'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="listitem row"><span>${x}</span>${ib('','projectLinksDialog()','link')}</div>`).join('')}`)}${surface('File permissions','<p class="muted">Client-visible documents are shared with the project’s client role. Internal notes remain available to the internal team. This demo previews the permissions without connecting to SharePoint.</p>')}</div></div>`}
function previewWorkspaceFile(i){let names=['Pilot brief.pdf','Data mapping.xlsx','Dashboard preview.pdf','Workshop notes.docx',...(state.localFiles||[])];draw(names[i],`<div class="paper"><span class="eyebrow">NINE-67 / PROJECT DOCUMENT</span><div class="rule"></div><h2>${esc(names[i].split('.')[0])}</h2><p>${['The pilot connects reporting inputs into a shared view of owners, exceptions, and next actions.','Sample mapping: project ID, owner, status, due date, and reporting exception.','The dashboard preview brings open requests, overdue handoffs, and ownership into one view.','Workshop outcomes: confirm the reporting owner, validate the source data, and define success measures.'][i]||'This local file is represented by its name in the prototype. Its contents are not uploaded.'}</p><div class="paperfoot">ILLUSTRATIVE DOCUMENT PREVIEW</div></div>`)}
function addWorkspaceFile(){draw('Add a project file',`<label class="field">Choose a file<input type="file" onchange="if(this.files[0]){state.localFiles=state.localFiles||[];state.localFiles.push(this.files[0].name);closeDrawer();render();toast('File represented locally; not uploaded')}"></label><div class="callout">The prototype stores the file name for demonstration. No file contents are sent to SharePoint.</div>`)}
function projectLinksDialog(){draw('Project links',`${['Project plan','Success measures','File workspace','Stakeholder access'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="listitem row"><b>${x}</b>${ib('Open',`closeDrawer();tab=${[1,1,2,3][i]};render()`,'arrow')}</div>`).join('')}`)}
function collaborationPeople(){return `<div class="appbody"><div class="sectionhead"><div><h2>Every stakeholder, the right view.</h2><p>Separate access for the internal team, clients, and contractors.</p></div>${tag('Role preview')}</div>${surface('Project members',table(['Person','Role','Access',''],[['Alex Morgan','Internal team','All project management tools'],['Taylor Kim','Internal team','Build, files, and discussions'],['Morgan Hayes','Client','Shared milestones, files, and approvals'],['Jamie Park','Contractor','Assigned tasks and shared deliverables']].map(([n,r,a])=>[`<div class="person">${ava(n)}<b>${n}</b></div>`,tag(r,r==='Internal team'?'green':''),a,ib('Preview role',`state.role='${r}';tab=0;render()`,'user')])))}<div class="decisionstrip" style="margin-top:22px"><div class="dsicon">${icon('lock')}</div><div><b>Enterprise access, designed around the project.</b><p>Microsoft sign-in for internal teams, with separate client and contractor experiences. Sign-in is simulated here.</p></div></div></div>`}
const reports=[['Sales performance','Sales','Monthly revenue, pipeline & conversion',5],['Team capacity','Delivery','Weekly resource load and availability',6],['Project health','Delivery','Milestones, risks & delivery confidence',11],['Webinar engagement','Marketing','Attendance, audience signals & follow-up',1],['Budget variance','Finance','Plan, department allocations & variance',4],['Forecast scenarios','Finance','Assumptions, sensitivity & comparisons',9],['Project ROI','Finance','Investment, benefits & payback',10],['Prospect intelligence','Growth','Company research & outreach preparation',12]];
function insightsSaas(){if(tab===1)return reportLibrary();if(tab===2)return crossReportSaas();let h=v2[8]();return h.replace('<div class="dashboardtop">',`<div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><span class="projectphase">${icon('insights')} Executive workspace</span><span class="projectphase">All business functions</span></div><div class="controlgroup">${ib('Browse reports','tab=1;render()','file')}${ib('Connected sources','reportSourcesDialog()','link')}</div></div><div class="dashboardtop">`)}
function reportLibrary(){return `<div class="appbody"><div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><input placeholder="Search all reports…" oninput="filterTableRows(this.value,'reportrow')"><select onchange="filterTableRows(this.value==='All functions'?'':this.value,'reportrow')"><option>All functions</option>${['Sales','Delivery','Marketing','Finance','Growth'].map(x=>`<option>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>${tag('8 featured reports')}</div>${surface('Your report library',`<div class="reporttable">${table(['Report','Function','Refresh','Owner',''],reports.map((r,i)=>[`<div class="person"><span class="reporticon">${icon(productIcons[r[3]])}</span><div><b>${r[0]}</b><small>${r[2]}</small></div></div>`,tag(r[1]),'<span class="status-dot"></span> Updated today',['Alex Morgan','Jordan Ellis','Taylor Kim'][i%3],ib('Open report',`nav(${r[3]})`,'arrow')])).replaceAll('<tr>','<tr class="reportrow">')}</div>`)}<div class="inapp-ai" style="margin-top:22px">${icon('spark')}<span><b>One question can span several reports.</b> Ask how revenue expectations affect team capacity or project delivery.</span>${ib('Ask','askReports()','arrow')}</div></div>`}
function crossReportSaas(){return `<div class="appbody"><div class="querybar">${icon('spark')}<input id="reportQuestion" placeholder="How does the sales pipeline affect next month's delivery capacity?">${ib('Ask','askReports()','arrow','primary')}</div><div class="two equal">${surface('Growth meets delivery',`<span class="sourcebadge">SALES × RESOURCE ALLOCATION</span><h2 style="font-size:23px;margin:21px 0 15px;line-height:1.35">Two potential wins.<br>One capacity decision.</h2><p class="muted">Two late-stage opportunities drive 41% of weighted pipeline. If both close, current delivery capacity will need to be reviewed before kickoff dates are confirmed.</p><div class="suggestions">${tag('Sales performance')}${tag('Team capacity')}</div>${ib('Explore the resource plan','nav(6)','arrow','primary')}`)}${surface('Investment meets adoption',`<span class="sourcebadge">PROJECT ROI × DELIVERY</span><h2 style="font-size:23px;margin:21px 0 15px;line-height:1.35">The benefit depends on<br>the team using it.</h2><p class="muted">The business case uses an adoption assumption. Pilot participation and weekly active usage can help validate whether the expected capacity value is realistic.</p><div class="suggestions">${tag('Project ROI')}${tag('Project health')}</div>${ib('Test adoption sensitivity','nav(10)','arrow','primary')}`)}</div></div>`}
function reportSourcesDialog(){draw('Connected report sources',`${[['Sales records','Revenue and opportunities'],['Project workspace','Milestones and delivery'],['Resource plan','Assignments and availability'],['Finance inputs','Budgets and assumptions'],['Marketing events','Webinar engagement']].map(([x,y])=>`<div class="listitem"><div class="row"><b>${x}</b>${tag('Sample source')}</div><p>${y}</p></div>`).join('')}<p class="sidehelp">The prototype uses illustrative data. Source connections are architecture examples.</p>`)}
function forecastSaas(){let h=v2[9]();h=h.replace('<div class="scenarioCanvas">',`<div class="scenarioCanvas"><div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><span class="projectphase">${icon('forecast')} Revenue model</span><span class="projectphase">Q1 2027 outlook</span></div>${ib('Scenario library','forecastLibrary()','file')}</div>`);return h}
function forecastLibrary(){draw('Scenario library',`${[['Baseline',0,32],['Conservative',5,30],['Growth',20,38]].map(([n,g,w])=>`<div class="listitem"><div class="row"><b>${n}</b><span class="score" style="font-size:20px">$${(3.84*(1+g/100)*w/32).toFixed(2)}M</span></div><p class="muted">${g}% pipeline growth · ${w}% win rate</p>${ib('Load scenario',`state.growth=${g};state.win=${w};closeDrawer();tab=0;render()`,'arrow')}</div>`).join('')}${(state.savedScenarios||[]).map((s,i)=>`<div class="listitem"><div class="row"><b>Saved scenario ${i+1}</b><span>$${s.value.toFixed(2)}M</span></div><p>${s.growth}% growth · ${s.win}% win rate</p>${ib('Load',`state.growth=${s.growth};state.win=${s.win};closeDrawer();tab=0;render()`,'arrow')}</div>`).join('')}`)}
function roiSaas(){if(tab===1)return roiEvidenceSaas();let h=v2[10]();return h.replace('<div class="sectionhead">',`<div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><span class="projectphase">${icon('roi')} Project investment model</span><span class="projectphase">12-month value horizon</span></div>${ib('Model methodology','roiMethodology()','help')}</div><div class="sectionhead">`)}
function roiEvidenceSaas(){return `<div class="appbody"><div class="decisionstrip"><div class="dsicon">${icon('check')}</div><div><b>Confidence comes from the inputs.</b><p>Validate the baseline, cost, and adoption assumptions before relying on the business case.</p></div>${tag(state.validEvidence.every(Boolean)?'Reviewed':'Estimates',state.validEvidence.every(Boolean)?'green':'amber')}</div>${surface('Assumption register',table(['Assumption','Current value','Evidence needed','Reviewed'],[['Time saved',state.hours+' hrs / week','Workflow observation or time study'],['Loaded hourly cost',money(state.rate),'Finance-approved cost estimate'],['Adoption',state.adoption+'%','Pilot participation or usage data']].map(([x,y,z],i)=>[x,y,z,`<input type="checkbox" class="rowcheck" aria-label="Review ${x}" ${state.validEvidence[i]?'checked':''} onchange="state.validEvidence[${i}]=this.checked;state.roiEvidence=state.validEvidence.every(Boolean);persist();render()">`])))}<div class="two equal" style="margin-top:22px">${surface('Supporting notes',`<textarea style="min-height:180px" placeholder="Capture where assumptions came from and what still needs validation…" oninput="state.roiNotes=this.value;persist()">${esc(state.roiNotes||'')}</textarea>`)}${surface('What confidence does—and does not—mean','<p class="muted">Reviewing inputs improves the transparency of the estimate. It does not turn time saved into guaranteed cash savings, or guarantee adoption. Revisit the model after the first pilot milestone.</p>'+ib('Return to business case','tab=0;render()','arrow','primary'))}</div></div>`}
function roiMethodology(){draw('How the business case is calculated',`<div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">1</span><div><b>Annual gross benefit</b><p>Hours saved per week × 52 weeks × loaded hourly cost × adoption.</p></div></div><div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">2</span><div><b>Net recurring benefit</b><p>Annual gross benefit − 12 months of running costs.</p></div></div><div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">3</span><div><b>Year-one ROI</b><p>(Net recurring benefit − build cost) ÷ build cost × 100%.</p></div></div><div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">4</span><div><b>Payback</b><p>Build cost ÷ annual net recurring benefit × 12 months, when recurring benefit is positive.</p></div></div><div class="callout" style="margin-top:20px">The waterfall updates from your current inputs. Compare the benefit, running costs, build cost, and year-one net value.</div>`)}
function trackerSaas(){if(tab===2)return projectDecisionsSaas();if(tab===1)return v2[11]();let arr=projects.map((n,i)=>({name:n,index:i,status:[1,4].includes(i)?'Needs attention':'On track'})).filter(p=>state.projectFilter==='All projects'||p.status===state.projectFilter);return `<div class="appbody"><div class="productpage-toolbar"><div class="controlgroup"><select onchange="state.projectFilter=this.value;render()">${['All projects','On track','Needs attention'].map(x=>`<option ${state.projectFilter===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select><span class="projectphase">${arr.length} initiatives</span></div><div class="controlgroup"><div class="segmented">${ib('Grid','state.projectView="grid";render()','grid',state.projectView==='grid'?'active':'')}${ib('List','state.projectView="list";render()','list',state.projectView==='list'?'active':'')}</div></div></div>${slim([['Initiatives',String(projects.length+(state.newProjects||[]).length),'Across your business'],['On track','4','Upcoming milestones confirmed'],['Needs a decision',String(2-[state.decision0,state.decision1].filter(Boolean).length),'Data access & baseline'],['Milestones completed','18','Program to date']])}${state.projectView==='list'?surface('Initiative register',table(['Initiative','Stage','Progress','Status',''],arr.map(p=>[p.name,['Pilot','Discovery','Build','Live','Design','Build'][p.index],[78,18,54,100,32,65][p.index]+'%',tag(p.status,p.status==='On track'?'green':'amber'),ib('Open',`openProjectRecord(${p.index})`,'arrow')]))):`<div class="portfolioGrid">${arr.map(p=>{let i=p.index;return `<button class="projectcard" onclick="openProjectRecord(${i})"><div class="row"><div class="projecticon">${icon(['sales','insights','resources','collab','forecast','response'][i])}</div>${tag(p.status,p.status==='On track'?'green':'amber')}</div><h2>${p.name}</h2><p>${['A shared view of reporting, exceptions, and ownership.','Connect commercial signals to actionable account insight.','Match team availability to delivery commitments.','One home for conversations, files, and decisions.','Turn financial assumptions into planning scenarios.','Make every webinar follow-up relevant.'][i]}</p><div class="row">${tag(['Pilot','Discovery','Build','Live','Design','Build'][i])}<div class="stackedavatars">${ava('Alex Morgan')}${ava(['Taylor Kim','Jordan Ellis','Sam Rivera'][i%3])}</div></div><div class="metricline"><span>Overall progress</span><b>${[78,18,54,100,32,65][i]}%</b></div>${bar([78,18,54,100,32,65][i],i===3)}<div class="bottom"><span>${['Pilot review · Oct 23','Data access · Oct 21','Team test · Oct 28','Monthly review · Oct 30','Baseline approval · Oct 22','Campaign test · Oct 26'][i]}</span>${icon('arrow')}</div></button>`}).join('')}</div>`}${(state.newProjects||[]).length?`<div class="sectionhead" style="margin-top:24px"><h2>New initiatives</h2></div><div class="portfolioGrid">${state.newProjects.map((x,i)=>`<div class="projectcard"><div class="row"><span class="projecticon">${icon('projects')}</span>${tag('Discovery')}</div><h2>${esc(x.name)}</h2><p>${esc(x.brief)}</p><span class="subtle">Owner: ${esc(x.owner)}</span></div>`).join('')}</div>`:''}<div class="inapp-ai" style="margin-top:24px">${icon('spark')}<span><b>${2-[state.decision0,state.decision1].filter(Boolean).length} decisions remain open.</b> Review source access and the finance baseline before the next phase.</span>${ib('Review decisions','tab=2;render()','arrow')}</div></div>`}
function openProjectRecord(i){draw(projects[i],`<div class="row">${tag([1,4].includes(i)?'Needs attention':'On track',[1,4].includes(i)?'amber':'green')}<span class="sourcebadge">NINE-67 DELIVERY</span></div><div class="metadata"><div><label>PROJECT OWNER</label><b>Alex Morgan</b></div><div><label>CURRENT PHASE</label><b>${['Pilot','Discovery','Build','Live','Design','Build'][i]}</b></div></div><h2 style="margin:28px 0 5px">Milestones</h2>${['Confirm workflow and success measures','Connect approved source data','Demonstrate first iteration','Pilot, measure, and refine'].map((x,j)=>`<div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">${j<2?'✓':j+1}</span><div><b>${x}</b><p>${j<2?'Completed':'Upcoming milestone'}</p></div></div>`).join('')}<h2 style="margin-top:25px">Project notes</h2><textarea id="projectRecordNote" style="min-height:140px" placeholder="Add an update, decision, or open question…">${esc(state.projectNotes[i]||'')}</textarea><div class="suggestions">${ib('Save update',`state.projectNotes[${i}]=document.getElementById('projectRecordNote').value;persist();toast('Project note saved')`,'check','primary')}${ib('Collaboration workspace','closeDrawer();nav(7)','collab')}</div>`)}
function projectDecisionsSaas(){return `<div class="appbody"><div class="sectionhead"><div><h2>The decisions that move delivery forward.</h2><p>Resolve dependencies before they become delays.</p></div>${tag((2-[state.decision0,state.decision1].filter(Boolean).length)+' open decisions','amber')}</div>${surface('Decision register',table(['Decision','Project','Owner','Due','Status',''],[['Approve CRM data access','Sales intelligence','IT owner','Oct 21'],['Confirm forecast baseline','Financial forecasting','Finance owner','Oct 22']].map((d,i)=>[d[0],d[1],d[2],d[3],tag(state['decision'+i]?'Resolved':'Open',state['decision'+i]?'green':'amber'),ib(state['decision'+i]?'Reopen':'Resolve',`state['decision'+${i}]=!state['decision'+${i}];render()`,'check')])))}<div class="two equal" style="margin-top:22px">${surface('Risk to watch','<p class="muted">A delay in approved source access can move the start of the build phase. Confirm a named decision owner and an expected resolution date.</p>')}${surface('Keep stakeholders aligned','<p class="muted">Project notes and the collaboration workspace provide a shared place for decisions, context, and next actions.</p>'+ib('Open collaboration','nav(7)','arrow'))}</div></div>`}
function newProjectDialog(){draw('Add an initiative',field('Initiative name','initiativeName','')+field('Project owner','initiativeOwner','Alex Morgan')+`<label class="field">What should this solve?<textarea id="initiativeBrief" placeholder="Describe the workflow and the intended outcome…"></textarea></label>`+ib('Create initiative',"let n=document.getElementById('initiativeName').value.trim();if(n){state.newProjects=state.newProjects||[];state.newProjects.push({name:n,owner:document.getElementById('initiativeOwner').value,brief:document.getElementById('initiativeBrief').value});tab=0;closeDrawer();render()}else toast('Add an initiative name')",'plus','primary'))}
function nightwatchSaas(){if(tab===1)return nightwatchBriefing();if(tab===2)return nightwatchSettings();let h=v2[12]();h=h.replace('<div class="sectionhead"><h2>Companies</h2>',`<div class="sectionhead"><h2>Company lists</h2>`).replace('<div class="nightlayout">',`<div class="nightlayout">`);h=h.replace('<div class="draftbottom">',`<div class="draftbottom">`);return h}
function nightwatchBriefing(){return `<div class="appbody"><div class="productpage-toolbar"><div><h2 style="font-size:23px;margin:0 0 8px">A more informed start to your day.</h2><p class="muted" style="font-size:11px;margin:0">Monday, October 19 · Research briefing</p></div><span class="sourcebadge">Last sample run · 2:00 AM</span></div>${slim([['Companies researched',state.night?'54':'50','Matched against the target profile'],['Qualified matches',state.night?'28':'24','Fit & relevance reviewed'],['Message versions','72','Three angles per company'],['Ready to review','12','Email & LinkedIn']])}<div class="revenue-detail">${surface('Your next conversations',table(['Company','Why now','Fit',''],companies.map((c,i)=>[`<div class="person"><div class="profilelogo" style="width:32px;height:32px;font-size:11px">${c.split(' ').map(x=>x[0]).join('')}</div><div><b>${c}</b><small>${['Manufacturing · PA','Professional services · NJ','Distribution · NY','Engineering · PA'][i]}</small></div></div>`,['Facility expansion','Operations leadership hiring','Systems modernization','Growing project backlog'][i],tag([94,89,86,82][i],'green'),ib('Explore',`state.company=${i};tab=0;render()`,'arrow')])))}${surface('The overnight workflow',`${[['Research companies','Industry, size, geography, and signals'],['Understand the opportunity','Workflow friction and a relevant starting point'],['Draft the conversation','Concrete idea, direct offer, delivery experience'],['Prepare for review','Research context and outreach variants']].map(([x,y],i)=>`<div class="progressstep"><span class="circle">✓</span><div><b>${x}</b><p>${y}</p></div></div>`).join('')}`)}</div></div>`}
function nightwatchSettings(){let set=state.nightSettings||{industries:'Manufacturing, professional services, distribution',geography:'Pennsylvania, New York, New Jersey',revenue:'$10M–$1B',count:50,time:'02:00'};return `<div class="appbody"><div class="two" style="grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr">${surface('Define the nightly brief',`<p class="muted" style="font-size:11px">Give the research workflow a clear definition of a relevant company.</p>${field('Target industries','nightIndustries',set.industries)}${field('Geography','nightGeography',set.geography)}${field('Revenue range','nightRevenue',set.revenue)}<div class="two equal">${field('Companies per run','nightCount',set.count,'number')}${field('Research time','nightTime',set.time,'time')}</div><label class="field">Signals to prioritize<textarea id="nightSignals">${esc(state.nightSignals||'Expansion, leadership hiring, systems changes, and operational complexity.')}</textarea></label>${ib('Save research brief',"state.nightSettings={industries:document.getElementById('nightIndustries').value,geography:document.getElementById('nightGeography').value,revenue:document.getElementById('nightRevenue').value,count:+document.getElementById('nightCount').value,time:document.getElementById('nightTime').value};state.nightSignals=document.getElementById('nightSignals').value;persist();toast('Research brief saved. No live scheduled job created.')",'check','primary')}`)}<div class="stack" style="align-content:start">${surface('Quality gates',`${['Verify company fit','Record source and publication date','Check suppression lists','Review contact confidence','Generate three outreach angles'].map(x=>`<div class="listitem row"><span style="font-size:11px">${x}</span>${icon('check')}</div>`).join('')}`)}${surface('Your review stays central','<p class="muted">Company research and message drafts are prepared for human judgment. The prototype makes no external calls and sends no outreach.</p>')}</div></div></div>`}
const saasViews=[proposalSaas,responseSaas,triageSaas,simulationSaas,budgetSaas,salesSaas,resourcesSaas,collaborationSaas,insightsSaas,forecastSaas,roiSaas,trackerSaas,nightwatchSaas];
let routingFromHistory=false,portfolioRoutesReady=false;
const productRender=render;
render=function(){productRender();if(portfolioRoutesReady && typeof history!=="undefined"){const slug=current<0?'home':toolsList[current][0].toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-');const screen=current<0?'':('/'+(subnavs[current][tab]||subnavs[current][0]).toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-').replaceAll('&','and'));const target=current<0 && portfolioView==='process'?'#our-process':'#'+slug+(current>=0 && applicationView==='overview'?'/how-it-works':screen);if(location.hash!==target){if(routingFromHistory)history.replaceState(null,'',target);else history.pushState(null,'',target);}}};
nav=function(n){current=n;tab=0;render();window.scrollTo(0,0)};
function restoreProductRoute(){let parts=location.hash.slice(1).split('/');let n=toolsList.findIndex(x=>x[0].toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-')===parts[0]);if(portfolioRoutesReady){applicationView=parts[1]==='how-it-works'?'overview':'preview';portfolioView=parts[0]==='our-process'?'process':'projects'}current=n;tab=n<0?0:Math.max(0,(subnavs[n]||[]).findIndex(x=>x.toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-').replaceAll('&','and')===parts[1]));routingFromHistory=true;render();routingFromHistory=false;}
window.addEventListener('popstate',restoreProductRoute);
restoreProductRoute();
